<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῷος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of, from the island</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῶς</span>, <i>Coan,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.195.7
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.164
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κώϊος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				254
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῷος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλος</span>), ὁ, <i>the highest
				throw with the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστράγαλοι</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χῖος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κῷα</span> are <i>the
			inner</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χῖα</span>
			<i>the outer, sides</i> of the <i>huckle</i>-bones (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστράγαλοι</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				499b28
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶλα</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχία</span> codd.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cael.</u>
				292a29
			</span></i> (v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῷον</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>), τό,
				<i>a light semi-transparent garment, made at Cos</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a measure of wine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Fay.</u>
				44
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				531 ii 8
			</span></i>: pl. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				7199.2
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέχυρον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώϊον</span>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖον, κοῦα</span>.</div>
